      "side": 1,
      "message": "Consider wrapping the plugin `callback(...)` in a `try ... catch` block here. If a third-party plugin throws a synchronous error inside this subscriber, RxJS will rethrow it, which can interrupt other subscribers and disrupt state updates. Wrapping it and logging or reporting the error (similar to how other JS API bridges protect host stability in `gr-js-api-interface-element.ts`) would prevent plugin exceptions from affecting the core UI.",
      "isAi": true,
      "revId": "9d7bae51e6e6e063bf62a8a2b8f7130c29f7dd9e",
